{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44906","headline":"春晚喜悟禅师自琉璃上方见过 · 无可","name":"春晚喜悟禅师自琉璃上方见过","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琉璃师到城，谈性外诸经。\n下岭雪霜在，近人林木清。\n苔痕深草履，瀑布滴铜瓶。\n乐问山中事，宵言彻晓星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}